're russian originated  in russia  a little bit of french sea salt and now  the beet dust this is the key a  tablespoon of sugar  a teaspoon of beet powder  and it's just this little fairy dust  that you sprinkle  all over including on the side of the  plate  and then very quickly off with the  cheese  a little bit over here and a little bit  over here  which i almost forgot here we go  and just a little bit of beef powder on  those because it turns a little bit gray  and the beet powder brings it back to  blue  and there you have it you love that  beautiful summer salad i had no idea  that beet powder was a thing and like we  said  10 ingredients nanny bubbe you always  have  the best recipes that looks delicious  you can't be beat  at that thank you you can't be beat  check out danny bubby's kitchen and  garden on social media and online at  nannybubby.com  thank you to chapman automotive for  sponsoring the segment las vegas now  we'll be right back

